ve_context(self, inputs: Dict[str, Any], outputs: Dict[str, str]) -> None:\n+        \"\"\"Save context from this conversation to buffer.\"\"\"\n+        summary = self.buffer\n+        new_lines = \"\\n\".join(\n```"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "uber nit: the formatting here is ugly, would consider doing stuff on their own lines to make nicer\r\n\r\neg\r\n```\r\nhuman = \"Human: \" + inputs\r\nai = \"AI: \" + outputs\r\nnew_lines = \"\\n\".join([human, ai])\r\n```"}]}
