pipeline.task not in VALID_TASKS:\n+                raise ValueError(\n+                    f\"Got invalid task {pipeline.task}, \"\n+                    f\"currently only {VALID_TASKS} are supported\"\n+                )\n+\n+            return cls(pipeline=pipeline, **kwargs)\n```"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "we should probably also pass in model_id and model_kwargs now that we're keeping them around"}]}
